WEBVTT

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:08.250
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:14.760
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:16.590
It's my day!

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:27.170
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:34.580
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:41.950
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:49.360
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:55.130
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.630 --> 00:01:02.270
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.440 --> 00:01:09.780
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.480 --> 00:01:15.920
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:18.990
I just want to walk

00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:22.530
Not on tip-toe

00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:26.500
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.460 --> 00:01:35.400
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:41.840
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:41.840 --> 00:01:44.110
It's my day!

00:01:50.050 --> 00:01:52.780
<i>I love Rui Hanazawa.</i>

00:02:04.230 --> 00:02:08.200
Check out the Cartio watch
I got in New York this summer.

00:02:08.870 --> 00:02:11.710
For real?
You've already got a Ronlex!

00:02:14.140 --> 00:02:15.210
What are you doing?

00:02:16.910 --> 00:02:18.010
Domyoji...

00:02:19.580 --> 00:02:21.920
You bumped my shoulder,
didn't you?

00:02:25.450 --> 00:02:33.130
"Tsukasa Domyoji Snaps!"

00:02:42.770 --> 00:02:44.170
Fall's here already...

00:02:44.670 --> 00:02:47.510
When we first met,
the roses were in bloom.

00:02:49.080 --> 00:02:49.740
Really?

00:02:50.610 --> 00:02:53.580
You were screaming about
being hit with raw eggs, right?

00:02:55.780 --> 00:02:58.750
You were so loud,
I didn't notice the roses.

00:03:00.090 --> 00:03:02.790
P-please... do you have to
keep reminding me?

00:03:02.890 --> 00:03:04.390
Yeah... that's the voice.

00:03:06.090 --> 00:03:07.360
Rui!

00:03:11.800 --> 00:03:13.500
Shizuka... what are you doing here?

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:16.770
I've got a shoot for the studio.

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:20.910
So I can't go to the club
with you tonight.

00:03:22.410 --> 00:03:24.380
Oh, Makino... hello.

00:03:25.210 --> 00:03:25.810
Hi.

00:03:26.910 --> 00:03:29.750
Come to the studio with me, Rui?

00:03:30.250 --> 00:03:30.680
Huh?

00:03:31.550 --> 00:03:35.220
When I go by myself,
people keep asking me out.

00:03:38.660 --> 00:03:39.290
Please?

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:40.960
Okay.

00:03:41.430 --> 00:03:44.630
Really? Thanks. What a relief...

00:03:46.260 --> 00:03:47.330
By the way, Makino.

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:51.540
I'm having a birthday party next week.

00:03:52.170 --> 00:03:55.170
It's just a casual thing at my house,
so please come.

00:03:55.740 --> 00:03:58.040
Who, me? I couldn't...

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:04.050
Please join me...

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:06.420
But... but... but...

00:04:06.950 --> 00:04:10.990
<i>Oh no... what if I stand out
like at Asai's party?</i>

00:04:12.260 --> 00:04:14.190
Everyone will dress casual.

00:04:15.090 --> 00:04:18.900
But if you're worried,
you can borrow my evening gown.

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:24.070
Besides, I'm not inviting
your classmates, so don't worry.

00:04:36.610 --> 00:04:41.350
<i>She predicted and worked out
my every worry.</i>

00:04:44.420 --> 00:04:45.320
<i>I can't compete with her.</i>

00:04:45.820 --> 00:04:49.060
<i>No... it's wrong to even think
in those terms.</i>

00:04:52.590 --> 00:04:53.430
<i>She's wonderful.</i>

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:00.770
What's going on?

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:01.870
What happened?

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:03.170
Over there!

00:05:04.040 --> 00:05:04.940
This way!

00:05:05.210 --> 00:05:06.010
It's awful!

00:05:08.210 --> 00:05:11.180
Don't tell me
Kazuya's being bullied again!

00:05:12.610 --> 00:05:13.480
How horrible!

00:05:14.720 --> 00:05:15.520
What is it?

00:05:15.850 --> 00:05:16.680
Should we do something?

00:05:19.850 --> 00:05:20.490
Tsukushi!

00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:22.220
Is it Kazuya?

00:05:22.720 --> 00:05:25.190
This is messed up! It's him!

00:05:31.570 --> 00:05:32.570
<i>Domyoji...</i>

00:05:33.330 --> 00:05:34.870
Say something!

00:05:35.770 --> 00:05:37.570
I'm sorry. Please forgive me.

00:05:37.970 --> 00:05:38.940
"Sorry"?

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:43.280
That's all you have to say
for bumping into me?!

00:05:43.810 --> 00:05:46.210
Please... I'm sorry. I'm sorry!

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:49.280
Enough "sorry" s you little punk!

00:05:52.220 --> 00:05:53.820
Tsukasa, that's enough.

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:55.260
You'll kill him!

00:05:57.760 --> 00:05:58.560
Shut up.

00:05:59.260 --> 00:06:01.660
Like anyone'll miss him
when he's gone.

00:06:03.560 --> 00:06:04.300
He's lost it.

00:06:05.060 --> 00:06:06.300
There's no stopping him.

00:06:07.200 --> 00:06:09.170
Quit staring, you guys!

00:06:14.210 --> 00:06:15.370
Having fun?

00:06:16.210 --> 00:06:18.640
Enjoying the entertainment
the F4's giving you?

00:06:35.130 --> 00:06:38.030
Laugh. Come on, laugh.

00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:42.470
That's more like it.

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:48.910
Damn you!

00:06:48.940 --> 00:06:49.840
That's enough!

00:07:05.220 --> 00:07:05.990
Get out of my way.

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:09.060
This is the last straw.

00:07:09.560 --> 00:07:10.890
Shut up, bitch!

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:11.900
Stop it!

00:07:48.760 --> 00:07:49.670
Someone give me a hand.

00:07:49.730 --> 00:07:50.270
Yes ma'am.

00:08:15.690 --> 00:08:19.430
Tsukushi... what's gotten into him?

00:08:19.990 --> 00:08:20.760
I don't know.

00:08:21.760 --> 00:08:24.200
I've never seen him
like that before.

00:08:25.800 --> 00:08:27.370
If Ms. Urara hadn't come...

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:29.300
Who knows
what could've happened?

00:08:36.340 --> 00:08:41.580
<i>Something awful must've happened
for him to act like that...</i>

00:08:42.650 --> 00:08:43.480
Oh, there's my ride.

00:08:45.850 --> 00:08:49.160
Hey, Tsukushi. We've got physics 
homework today, right?

00:08:49.660 --> 00:08:50.690
Want to work on it together?

00:08:52.160 --> 00:08:52.790
Oh no!

00:08:55.360 --> 00:08:56.900
<i>I can't believe
I forgot my books!</i>

00:08:57.600 --> 00:08:59.670
<i>Running into Shizuka
made me so spacey.</i>

00:09:06.170 --> 00:09:06.810
<i>There they are!</i>

00:09:40.840 --> 00:09:41.410
Hey...

00:09:42.210 --> 00:09:45.510
You scared me.
What are you doing here?

00:09:49.210 --> 00:09:52.850
<i>Oh no... he's still got
that crazy look in his eyes.</i>

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:56.050
I forgot these.

00:09:57.320 --> 00:09:57.720
Bye!

00:09:57.890 --> 00:10:00.390
<i>I love Rui Hanazawa.</i>

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:03.060
That's...

00:10:17.140 --> 00:10:19.280
How dare you make a fool of me!

00:11:00.580 --> 00:11:02.790
How dare you make a fool of me!

00:11:04.820 --> 00:11:05.720
What're you doing?

00:11:06.120 --> 00:11:08.060
Move out of the way!
I'm gonna get mad.

00:11:22.600 --> 00:11:25.070
I'll call for help. I'll scream!

00:11:25.970 --> 00:11:28.310
Go ahead. No one'll help you.

00:11:29.240 --> 00:11:32.010
No one at this school would dare
stand up to me.

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:34.680
Including the teachers.

00:11:35.680 --> 00:11:37.020
Not Ms. Urara!

00:11:37.590 --> 00:11:38.220
Shut up!

00:11:38.750 --> 00:11:40.620
She doesn't know
what she's dealing with.

00:11:43.190 --> 00:11:44.890
I'll give her an education
soon enough.

00:11:47.530 --> 00:11:48.900
But not before
I teach you a lesson.

00:11:49.700 --> 00:11:53.200
What did I do?
I haven't done a thing! Why...?

00:11:53.200 --> 00:11:53.970
Shut up!

00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:34.570
You know what you did.

00:12:37.240 --> 00:12:37.880
No!

00:12:42.080 --> 00:12:43.620
S-somebody!

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:02.330
My leg!

00:13:36.470 --> 00:13:37.670
It's all your fault.

00:13:39.100 --> 00:13:41.040
Stop it! Stay away from me!

00:13:47.180 --> 00:13:49.680
No! You jerk! 
Don't come any closer!

00:13:53.920 --> 00:13:54.520
No!

00:13:56.190 --> 00:13:59.060
Stop it! Let me go, Domyoji!

00:14:00.620 --> 00:14:01.490
Let me go!

00:14:51.810 --> 00:14:53.440
<i>Don't just stand there.
Sit down.</i>

00:15:00.310 --> 00:15:02.650
Stop it, Domyoji...

00:15:05.890 --> 00:15:07.990
Please... don't...

00:15:31.710 --> 00:15:33.710
I won't do anything. Don't cry.

00:15:50.430 --> 00:15:51.130
Welcome home...

00:15:56.500 --> 00:15:58.240
Tsukushi, what happened?

00:15:59.910 --> 00:16:00.540
I fell.

00:16:01.040 --> 00:16:01.740
You <i>fell</i>?

00:16:02.740 --> 00:16:04.040
You look awful, Sis.

00:16:04.510 --> 00:16:06.880
You're so clumsy!

00:16:07.280 --> 00:16:11.920
There's blood on your blouse.
And you've lost a button!

00:16:12.350 --> 00:16:12.850
Blood?

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:17.360
Blouses don't just grow on trees,
you know.

00:16:17.990 --> 00:16:21.260
Tsukushi... when you fall,
do it properly.

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:23.160
Like this.

00:16:26.200 --> 00:16:27.930
Dear, stop that! Moron.

00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:43.250
<i>What's with him, anyway?
He was smiling this morning.</i>

00:16:51.060 --> 00:16:52.460
<i>Hey there, little hick Makino.</i>

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:02.570
<i>I can't figure out what's
going through his head.</i>

00:17:16.480 --> 00:17:17.310
<i>I was so scared.</i>

00:17:23.350 --> 00:17:25.220
<i>I never knew he was so strong.</i>

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:38.070
<i>I fought him tooth and nail
but he never gave an inch.</i>

00:17:39.330 --> 00:17:40.870
<i>He wasn't the Domyoji I know.</i>

00:17:42.970 --> 00:17:45.140
<i>I've never been so afraid
of a guy before.</i>

00:18:01.190 --> 00:18:03.260
No way! He really did that?

00:18:06.930 --> 00:18:08.000
That's awful!

00:18:09.530 --> 00:18:12.000
You're the only one I can talk to
about this, Yuki.

00:18:13.300 --> 00:18:14.270
I don't know what to do.

00:18:17.300 --> 00:18:20.840
But why would he do that to you?

00:18:21.540 --> 00:18:22.710
I don't know.

00:18:23.710 --> 00:18:26.580
He was goofing around
like always that morning.

00:18:30.050 --> 00:18:30.880
<i>It couldn't be!</i>

00:18:31.450 --> 00:18:33.820
<i>I love Rui Hanazawa.</i>

00:18:36.090 --> 00:18:37.090
<i>Is it because of that?</i>

00:18:38.660 --> 00:18:41.360
<i>But it's not like Rui feels the same way...</i>

00:18:42.260 --> 00:18:43.560
Tsukushi... are you okay?

00:18:43.830 --> 00:18:45.370
Huh? Yeah...

00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:50.400
It must've been scary
getting kissed like that.

00:18:51.170 --> 00:18:51.740
Yeah...

00:19:02.380 --> 00:19:03.250
<i>Don't cry.</i>

00:19:03.980 --> 00:19:08.750
<i>He may have been rough with me,
but he kissed so gently.</i>

00:19:09.660 --> 00:19:12.420
<i>Moron! What am I thinking?!</i>

00:19:13.160 --> 00:19:15.330
How's Domyoji been since then?

00:19:16.060 --> 00:19:19.030
I don't know.
I haven't seen him for days.

00:19:19.140 --> 00:19:21.030
He's probably skipping school.

00:19:21.200 --> 00:19:21.900
I see.

00:19:24.270 --> 00:19:26.540
By the way.
I wanted to ask you a favor.

00:19:26.870 --> 00:19:28.410
Would you come with me?

00:19:29.170 --> 00:19:31.640
What's this? An invitation?

00:19:32.810 --> 00:19:35.180
I've been invited to
a birthday party tonight.

00:19:35.480 --> 00:19:38.580
It's for Shizuka Todo.
She's a real socialite.

00:19:40.220 --> 00:19:42.690
I'm not in the mood for partying...

00:19:42.720 --> 00:19:46.490
but I promised I'd go, 
and I owe her a lot.

00:19:48.530 --> 00:19:50.530
I invited Kazuya too.

00:19:51.400 --> 00:19:54.530
Sure, I'll go. 
But what should I wear?

00:19:55.300 --> 00:19:56.470
Got me...

00:19:57.440 --> 00:20:00.200
I couldn't borrow from Shizuka again.

00:20:01.940 --> 00:20:02.840
I'm home!

00:20:03.910 --> 00:20:05.680
Your sister's back.

00:20:06.210 --> 00:20:07.640
Welcome home.

00:20:08.010 --> 00:20:10.350
Hi, Tsukushi. Long time no see.

00:20:10.750 --> 00:20:12.820
<i>Her sister's as flashy as ever!</i>

00:20:13.250 --> 00:20:14.380
A party?

00:20:14.750 --> 00:20:18.020
Leave it to me.
I'll give you total makeovers!

00:20:22.160 --> 00:20:23.460
Um...

00:20:33.270 --> 00:20:35.240
This look might be a little much.

00:20:35.370 --> 00:20:36.640
Are you kidding?

00:20:37.240 --> 00:20:40.010
If you want to get noticed,
you've got to make a statement.

00:20:42.110 --> 00:20:44.280
<i>This is one really loud statement.</i>

00:20:45.180 --> 00:20:46.050
<i>What am I gonna do?</i>

00:20:46.450 --> 00:20:48.820
<i>I can't show up at Shizuka's
dressed like this!</i>

00:20:51.120 --> 00:20:51.990
That's probably Kazuya.

00:20:53.560 --> 00:20:54.560
Good evening!

00:20:56.790 --> 00:20:58.190
Your ride has arrived.

00:21:04.900 --> 00:21:07.040
So this is the Todo home...

00:21:09.870 --> 00:21:12.740
<i>Whoa! What a house!</i>

00:21:19.610 --> 00:21:20.680
<i>Hang on...</i>

00:21:21.450 --> 00:21:24.220
<i>Shizuka would have invited the F4...</i>

00:21:24.490 --> 00:21:26.790
<i>Which means Domyoji will be here!</i>

00:21:30.460 --> 00:21:34.630
<i>How can I face him
after all that's happened?</i>

00:22:04.990 --> 00:22:11.060
You let your hair down a little

00:22:13.030 --> 00:22:18.940
You hid the fact
that you were crying

00:22:20.710 --> 00:22:28.810
I noticed, but I
couldn't ask you why

00:22:29.050 --> 00:22:36.860
I can never be
honest about how I feel

00:22:36.860 --> 00:22:44.630
Until after we've split
up after a bad fight

00:22:44.900 --> 00:22:52.770
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:22:44.900 --> 00:22:52.770
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:22:52.770 --> 00:23:01.150
I can say "I love you"...

00:22:52.770 --> 00:23:01.150
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:02.950 --> 00:23:10.920
Do you really hate me this time?

00:23:10.920 --> 00:23:18.700
Will you end up running to him?

00:23:18.960 --> 00:23:26.870
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:23:18.960 --> 00:23:26.870
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:26.870 --> 00:23:35.280
I can say "I love you"...

00:23:26.870 --> 00:23:35.280
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:47.220 --> 00:23:51.490
Shizuka looks radiant
since she's started following her dream.

00:23:52.430 --> 00:23:54.330
She knows...

00:23:54.400 --> 00:23:57.270
that no one can fulfill
your dream for you.

00:23:57.870 --> 00:24:00.670
You've got to do it yourself.

00:24:01.770 --> 00:24:04.670
Next on Hana Yori Dango:
"The Woman Who Gave Up Everything"

00:24:05.210 --> 00:24:07.180
No wonder everyone admires her...

00:24:07.580 --> 00:24:08.610
Including Rui Hanazawa.
